MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 NotTest_TestNot
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

NotTest_TestNot [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 1
CJUMP TEMP 1 L2
CJUMP MINUS 1 TEMP 1 L3
 
L2 
MOVE TEMP 2 100

 JUMP L4
L3 
MOVE TEMP 2 200


L4 NOOP

PRINT TEMP 2
CJUMP LE 5 3 L5
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE 5 3 L6
 
L5 
MOVE TEMP 2 300

 JUMP L7
L6 
MOVE TEMP 2 400


L7 NOOP

PRINT TEMP 2
CJUMP TEMP 1 L9
CJUMP MINUS 1 TEMP 1 L8
 
L8 
MOVE TEMP 2 500

 JUMP L10
L9 
MOVE TEMP 2 600


L10 NOOP

PRINT TEMP 2

RETURN 0
END

